# ntfy relay @VERSION@

Self-hosted ntfy @NTFY_VERSION@ for OpenCode: one Rust relay on the host, one
ntfy container, one token. The relay publishes turn text, permission asks, and
question forms to the phone, accepts prompts and native replies, and serves one
MCP file tool.

